r &#xa0;G, Kr&#xfc;ger &#xa0;M, Frenzel &#xa0;P. &#xa0;Comparing field and microcosm experiments: a case study on methano- and methylo-trophic bacteria in paddy soil. FEMS Microbiol Ecol. 2005;51:279&#x2013;91.. 10.1016/j.femsec.2004.09.007.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1016/j.femsec.2004.09.007</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">16329876</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Ettwig &#xa0;KF, Butler &#xa0;MK, Le&#xa0;Paslier &#xa0;D &#xa0;et al. &#xa0;Nitrite-driven anaerobic methane oxidation by oxygenic bacteria. Nature. 2010;464:543&#x2013;8.. 10.1038/nature08883.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1038/nature08883</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">20336137</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>

